HookMod_i386.so -- HookMod ("Hook Mod v5"), reconstructed from the shipped DLL, with HAVOC9 changes
====================================================================================================

What this is
------------

HookMod_i386.so is built from a clean, recompilable C++ reconstruction of the abandoned "Hook Mod v5"
(Drunken_F00l / Tony Paloma, adminop.net), a grappling hook that shipped only as a Windows binary with
no source. It was reverse-engineered into EntMod4/src/HookMod/ and is a Metamod-R plugin for The
Specialists on the H9XASH engine. This file is the Linux build, NEW to HAVOC9 -- no Linux HookMod
shipped originally; HookMod_MM.dll is the Windows build of the same source.

