The chain (newest last)
-----------------------

1. Reconstruction. Reverse-engineered from the shipped Windows HookMod_MM.dll into EntMod4/src/HookMod/
   (hook.cpp, hook_fire.cpp, cvars.cpp with the DF_hook_* cvars, the beam, and the Metamod glue).
   Metamod-only. This Linux build is NEW; no Linux HookMod shipped originally.

2. HAVOC9 gate. Loaded on every map but inert unless the map name contains "entmap", the map is in the
   entmod_maps cvar, or the operator set entmod_force 1 -- the same gate EntMod uses. DF_hook_on is the
   mod's own master switch on top of this. The decision is printed to the server console each map
   ("[HookMod] map '<name>' -> hook ON/off").
